  m_text: "I remember now. \n\nFour girls were in a sports car. \n\nIn a narrow alley
    near the school. \n\nThey hit a young woman\u2014 \nher clothes patched and worn.
    \n\nShe died there. \n\nBeside her, her brother screamed in despair. \n\n "
